WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.740
- All right, I love searching the internet

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:03.750
for the best stories that
might make you smile.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.532
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.532 --> 00:00:07.620
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:10.860
As we've mentioned, today is
International Day of the Girl,

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.650
which supports opportunities
for women and girls everywhere,

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.210
including sports.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.790
Often, women's sports
take a backseat to men's,

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.190
but not at a new sports
ball in Portland, Oregon.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.030
No ma'am.

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:24.570
The bar primarily plays
women's sports on their TVs.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:27.270
Even better is the name of the bar.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.320
You ready?

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:32.611
It's called Sports Bra,
which is, which is great.

00:00:32.611 --> 00:00:33.494
(applause)

00:00:33.494 --> 00:00:34.410
It's already, you wanna go.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:37.830
Here to talk about it is Jenny,
the owner of The Sports Bra,

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:39.870
watching on FOX 12 Oregon at 3.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:41.301
What's up, Jenny?

00:00:41.301 --> 00:00:42.870
(cheering)
(applause)

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:43.703
- Hi, Kelly.

00:00:43.703 --> 00:00:44.536
Thanks for having me.

00:00:44.536 --> 00:00:46.650
- Oh my God, thank you
for the name of your bar.

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:49.200
So, where did you get the idea for this?

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.180
- So, basically a bunch
of my friends and I,

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:52.260
we love playing sports

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:53.790
and after we would go play basketball,

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:57.300
we'd always wanna go watch
sports at a bar or something.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.850
And so, there was one time in 2018,

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:00.960
a bunch of friends of mine and I

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.870
went to go see a women's Final Four game.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:07.170
And we went into this sports
bar and there's 30 TVs;

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:08.550
none of 'em have the game on.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:10.560
And so we sit down, we ask
them to change the channel,

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:11.550
which they did,

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:13.800
and it's kind of in the
corner of this restaurant

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:15.870
and we watch this incredible game,

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:17.160
but without the sound on.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.980
And it was then that I realized
that if I ever wanted to

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:23.250
watch a women's sports
game in its full glory,

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:24.690
I'd have to open my own place.

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:25.680
And so that's what I did.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:29.820
In 2021, we opened The Sports
Bra here in Portland, Oregon

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:32.970
and since then we've
had incredible crowds.

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:36.690
For Serena's last match, we
had just an incredible crowd.

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:39.540
We had the WNBA finals here
and saw a ton of people.

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:42.330
The Portland Thorns get
a bunch of attention here

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:44.370
and it's just been great
having a space dedicated

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.330
to women's sports.

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:46.410
- That's incredible.

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:48.300
And you're not just supporting
women through sports.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:49.440
What else are you doing?

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.400
- That's correct.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.320
Basically, we're trying to support women

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:53.460
on and off the field.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:54.870
You know, the name The Sports Bra,

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:57.030
our motto is, "We support women."

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:00.270
And it's funny and it's
also what we try to do here.

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:02.880
We try to support our
local small businesses

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:04.440
that are women-owned and operated.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:06.780
For example, Freeland Spirits does a lot

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:08.640
of our signature cocktails.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.130
All the beef that we serve
here is from Carman Ranch;

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:13.028
it is a female rancher in Oregon.

00:02:13.028 --> 00:02:13.861
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:02:13.861 --> 00:02:15.300
- [Jenny] And then we have
21 taps and everything

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:18.840
on the taps is either owned,
operated, or made by women.

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.190
- I love--
- Even some of the furniture

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:24.270
in the restaurant is made
by girls who are young

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:26.310
and being trained to go into carpentry.

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:27.900
- That is so cool.

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.490
Like way to support your fellow women.

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:30.360
That's so cool.

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:32.130
Thank you so much, Jenny.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.740
I'm liking your post about
The Sports Bra right now

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:36.505
that supports all of us.

00:02:36.505 --> 00:02:37.350
(applause)

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:38.183
That's not all, though.

00:02:38.183 --> 00:02:40.830
Our season-long partner,
Pilot pen makers of G2,

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:42.660
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.910
they want to honor businesses
like The Sports Bra,

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:46.740
so they're gonna be writing you a check

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:48.831
for $1,000 just 'cause you're cool.

00:02:48.831 --> 00:02:49.664
(clapping)
(cheering)

00:02:49.664 --> 00:02:51.630
- Oh my God, cool.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:52.617
Thank you so much.

00:02:52.617 --> 00:02:54.030
- No, thank you so much, Jenny.

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:54.930
Have a blessed night.

00:02:54.930 --> 00:02:56.790
Thank you to all of our guests this hour.

00:02:56.790 --> 00:03:00.810
Sam Smith, Jacob Anderson,
Kylie, Laila, and Ms. La Pierre.

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:02.100
Y'all have a great day and if it's not,

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.163
try and change it.

